hakchi-cli
===========

A headless CLI for managing games on Nintendo Classic Mini consoles
running hakchi firmware, focused on macOS and Linux.

This project is a **derivative work** of concepts, protocols, and some
ported modules from Hakchi2-CE and related open-source projects. It is
**not** an official Team Shinkansen product and is not a drop-in
replacement for the Windows Hakchi2-CE GUI.

Credits and lineage
-------------------

### Hakchi2-CE (Team Shinkansen)

https://github.com/TeamShinkansen/Hakchi2-CE

Ported / reimplemented ideas and code paths include:

- Allwinner FEL client structure (FelLib lineage)
- Clovershell USB protocol (com.clusterrr.clovershell lineage)
- SNES canoe `.sfrom` packaging (SnesGame.MakeSfrom algorithm)
- Game desktop entry layout, CLV code generation, linked storage layout
- Default blank NES/SNES cart artwork from hakchi_gui images

