### This port

macOS/Linux userspace RNDIS Ethernet stack, CLI-first add-only game
upload (no full library sync), and packaging for NES/SNES are original
work for this repository, still under GPL-3 as part of the combined work.

If you improve shared protocol understanding (FEL, clovershell, canoe),
consider documenting changes for the wider hakchi community.
